menu "Slate M0"

    config SLATE_WIFI_SSID
        string "WiFi SSID"
        default ""
        help
            The network the Tab5 joins. ARCHITECTURE.md §Security allows WiFi
            credentials and the server address to live in firmware — they are the
            only secrets that may — but this repository is public, so put real
            values in sdkconfig.defaults.local (gitignored) rather than here.

    config SLATE_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi password"
        default ""
        help
            Leave empty for an open network. See the SSID help above: real values
            belong in sdkconfig.defaults.local, never in a committed file.

    config SLATE_SERVER_HOST
        string "Slate server host"
        default "192.168.1.197"
        help
            The deployment server (ARCHITECTURE.md §Deployment and test
            topology). v0.1 hard-codes it; the server picker arrives at v3.1.

    config SLATE_SERVER_PORT
        int "Slate server port"
        default 8000
        range 1 65535

    config SLATE_PAGE_PATH
        string "Page path"
        default "/apps/m0.xml"
        help
            Fetched once at boot over plain HTTP. No cache and no revalidation at
            v0.1 — honest caching is v1.1's whole phase.

endmenu
